    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385ca41def66e2a2dfdab74b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我也……正有些饥渴难耐。\n这次并跑，就让我好好享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "301d039e88ab66145faf61986b3b6f22e7095f24dadbfe06c51ce960ebbdf3ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fb6e63a099a66fa94ac1f42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，两人站在暮色渐浓的草地上。\n伴着清脆声响闸门开启――\n一场彼此争夺般的赛跑开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e84d02a57944420c1ac967d66a524c60e202b51b233fff8b5981dfd603e4ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913f96eb226656a386b7471e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥＆往昔",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c47f19d7c58c22acc4c3ca6a77fd8af5f40b001ad8b9ebd080350e99a606fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1955c1abcfbe3ec338543e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……！\n哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22cfb08bc9d86aa0daf30c4ae5e571f4ffc3cfeb66cd2f0e6d9381384aa27d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:868dd556a872e86d2c7bccda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔穷追不舍…激烈得让人\n甚至忘了…后冠路线GⅠ全制霸，这一称号――",
      "source_fingerprint": "355ce79d7262562adff81380193951667daca77e94d9179c5af0217ed2df496b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4faae8fedcdb4aaf2a8cc65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人转瞬飞驰过草地――\n最终仿佛相互纠缠般，\n一同冲过终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "649ac19671bb089b16f54d1bdacf8968416268f558b1df0e00386fbb4760a829",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27304abfcc3f385eca2efed6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
