    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710112047f941bec68948d45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以才说――这里果然有趣……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b86e39a552b0dcd4ab56708a01a4be30cffc5c1f3bc1ea91b739eb3bff8e093",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d7ef498f8b6699e5fe2749f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使获得史无前例的称号，\n前方阻拦的强敌依然众多。\n这就是――闪耀・系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c722cee41874481be4e916210c633c7b7435fa0b2f2e174764a3264198ca336",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c556b4e98bd4305e2f552968",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白高峰",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9114f1bcbc091e1f3a4b07bffba0d7513c42b1592606d536a89b9e36d03404b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b254e4dfa3ff3c3faa2a2bad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哎呀哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "982030e052181c76941572942127976ae91932f72892a01539c206d818982365",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7055738baafb2616aeac4460",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的双眼神采奕奕。\n这里，仍只行至半途。没错――\n她应抵达的地方，还在遥远的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be017c1c26bd65e80b2254e83f5ac1e855f3af42a7872326ad9e2817e6d471d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12b83256aaa65facda9ab85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可是史无前例的，后冠路线GⅠ全制霸！\n凭借这一壮举，\n西沙里奥一跃成为，当红赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "058e754d0f094debdb5375062fb525ea69d5f17b7f9962157f2bae36e56176f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b080533e6815bde67d30668",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其，这项成就在\n特雷森学园内引起的反响十分显著――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f851156a8b11969b16c0ac406077a6eb242738c27cb41ea5c7fae3af7cf7f816",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110118.json",
      "json_path": [
